BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-beer-and-banjos-20261110@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261116T055116Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T210000
SUMMARY:Beer and Banjos · Bowstring Pizza and Brewyard
LOCATION:Bowstring Pizza and Brewyard\, 1930 Wake Forest Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 
 27608
DESCRIPTION:Free family-friendly bluegrass and roots night every Tuesday\, 
 hosted by the Beer & Banjos All-Stars with a different guest each week. It
  draws a steady crowd of local pickers and fans. It is a concert\, not an 
 open jam.\n\nOn the patio in good weather\, inside by the bar in cold or r
 ain\n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: Nov 17 and Nov 24 are l
 isted. Check the holiday weeks (Dec 22 and 29).\n\nhttps://pinecone.org/ev
 ent/beer-and-banjos-emily-burdette/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://pinecone.org/event/beer-and-banjos-emily-burdette/
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="1930 Wake Forest Rd, Ralei
 gh, NC 27608";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Bowstring Pizza and Brewyard":geo
 :35.806482,-78.62458
END:VEVENT
