SUMMARY:Open mic with live band · Slim's Downtown
LOCATION:Slim's Downtown (Slim's Dive Bar)\, 227 S Wilmington St\, Raleigh\
 , NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Singers\, players\, poets and emcees take turns backed by a hou
 se band. It's a long-running downtown open mic with a regular crowd.\n\nEn
 ds at midnight\n\nHow to join: Sign up at the bar on the night\n\nBefore y
 ou go: Hours are unclear: 9pm to midnight or 8 to 11pm. Check with the ven
 ue. No sign-up time is posted.\n\nhttps://slimsdivebar.com/\n\nListed on S
 ame Time Next Week.
