SUMMARY:Sunday night swing · Raleigh Elks Lodge
LOCATION:Raleigh Elks Lodge No. 735\, 5538 Lead Mine Rd\, Raleigh\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Large weekly swing dance with a free lesson\; over 100 dancers 
 have been reported on a typical Sunday. Some Sundays add afternoon session
 s: ballroom on the 1st Sunday\, country on the 2nd.\n\nFree East Coast Swi
 ng lesson at 6pm\; Lindy/ECS/Blues 7-8:45\; West Coast Swing and Hustle 8:
 45-10\n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: North Raleigh\, about
  15 minutes from downtown. The holiday Sundays (Dec 20 and 27) and January
 -February aren't listed. Check the site.\n\nhttps://www.carolinadanceclub.
 com/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.carolinadanceclub.com/
