DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T203000
SUMMARY:Climbing meetup · Triangle Rock Club (Salvage Yard)
LOCATION:Triangle Rock Club - Salvage Yard (location rotates)\, 2330 Salvag
 e Yard Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27604
DESCRIPTION:Climbing group running since 2006 with 2\,000+ members. Beginne
 rs and people who can't belay yet are welcome\, and dinner afterward is pa
 rt of the routine.\n\nThe group rotates between Triangle Rock Club gyms ea
 ch Friday: Nov 13 here at Salvage Yard\, Nov 20 at the Durham gym. Optiona
 l group dinner around 8:45pm.\n\nHow to join: RSVP on Meetup\n\nBefore you
  go: Later Raleigh Fridays aren't visible yet. Check the Meetup page each 
 week.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/\n\nListed on Same Tim
 e Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/
END:VEVENT
