DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:Intro to improv class · ComedyWorx
LOCATION:ComedyWorx\, 3801 Hillsborough St\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:Multi-week beginner improv class where the same small group mee
 ts every week. The theater also runs public shows Friday and Saturday nigh
 ts.\n\nTwo sections: a Saturday class starting Jan 9 and a Monday class st
 arting Jan 11. Each meets weekly after that\, but the time and number of w
 eeks aren't shown.\n\nHow to join: Register online at comedyworx.com/class
 es\n\nBefore you go: Class times\, length and end dates aren't listed\; co
 ntact info@comedyworx.com. The first-Thursday Improv Jam isn't currently l
 isted.\n\nhttps://www.comedyworx.com/classes\n\nListed on Same Time Next W
 eek.
