SUMMARY:Java Jog Sunday run · The Bike Library
LOCATION:The Bike Library (TBL Cafe)\, 600 W Cabarrus St #113\, Raleigh\, N
 C 27603
DESCRIPTION:A casual\, entry-level Sunday morning group run from The Bike L
 ibrary's cafe in the Platform Raleigh courtyard. Pace varies by group\, an
 d everyone gets coffee afterward\, which makes it easy to get to know the 
 regulars.\n\nHow to join: Just show up at the TBL Cafe by 9:00 AM. The run
  heads out at 9:05 AM.\n\nBefore you go: The start time moved from 8 AM in
  October to 9 AM in November. Check the events page for the current time a
 nd route length.\n\nhttps://thebikelibrary.com/events\n\nListed on Same Ti
 me Next Week.
URL:https://thebikelibrary.com/events
END:VEVENT
