SUMMARY:Pickleball · First Presbyterian Church
LOCATION:First Presbyterian Church\, 112 S Salisbury St\, Raleigh\, NC 2760
 1
DESCRIPTION:Weekday-afternoon pickleball hosted by a downtown church\, list
 ed as no experience required. It's a low-pressure way to meet people while
  learning the game.\n\nHow to join: Show up at 1 PM on a Monday or Wednesd
 ay. To confirm where to go first\, call the church office at (919) 821-575
 0.\n\nBefore you go: The listing doesn't say where in the building play ha
 ppens or whether paddles are provided. Call (919) 821-5750 to confirm visi
 tors are welcome and where to enter.\n\nhttps://fpcraleigh.org/events/\n\n
 Listed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://fpcraleigh.org/events/
