DTSTAMP:20261116T055116Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T220000
SUMMARY:International folk dancing · Glen Eden Pilot Park
LOCATION:Glen Eden Pilot Park Community Center\, 1500 Glen Eden Dr\, Raleig
 h\, NC 27612
DESCRIPTION:Circle and line dances from cultures around the world\, with no
  partner needed. The Raleigh International Folk Dancers have met on Friday
 s since 1968\, and the early part of the night is for teaching easier danc
 es.\n\nEasier dances are taught early in the evening. From December the ci
 ty lists it as 6:30-9pm. On holiday weekends (like Nov 27)\, check with th
 e group first.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nhttps://www.trianglefolkdan
 cers.org/home/rifd\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.trianglefolkdancers.org/home/rifd
