DTSTAMP:20261116T055116Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T120000
SUMMARY:Invasive plant removal with live music · Walnut Creek Trail
LOCATION:Walnut Creek Wetland Park\, 950 Peterson St\, Raleigh\, NC 27610
DESCRIPTION:Help park staff cut and haul invasive plants along the Walnut C
 reek Trail while small musical groups from Fuller Forests play along the g
 reenway. Everyone gathers at the end for a final performance.\n\nHow to jo
 in: Create a free account in Raleigh Parks' CERVIS volunteer system and si
